            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked about the timing of a preliminary injunction right in this situation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ac3c5524336d6f6faaa187ad300efe6dd5fa95ea0d429dab75de6c252c57462",
