            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Shell, the parties dispute whether a dealer who continues to occupy premises without fuel supply constitutes a \u201ctermination\u201d under the PMPA."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Dealers",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ac3c5524336d6f6faaa187ad300efe6dd5fa95ea0d429dab75de6c252c57462",
            "evidence_ids": [
